oc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>74</volume>:<fpage>4411</fpage>&#x02013;4414.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">270685</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib38"><citation citation-type="journal">Yan, Q., and W.J. Lennarz. <year>2002</year>. Studies on the function of the oligosaccharyltransferase subunits: Stt3p is directly involved in the glycosylation process. <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>277</volume>:<fpage>47692</fpage>&#x02013;47700.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12359722</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>